OL,3,GNEWSAWorker jabbed with needle during
OL,4,Aclean-up after bin lorry fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council worker has been jabbed with a
OL,7,Fneedle while cleaning up rubbish
OL,8,Ffollowing another bin lorry fire in
OL,9,FGlasgow.
OL,11,FThe fire happened in Wilton Court at
OL,12,Fabout 11:30 and forced the refuse
OL,13,Fvehicle to dump its rubbish on the
OL,14,Fstreet. Discarded vapes were found
OL,15,Famong the waste.
OL,17,FGMB union convener Chris Mitchell said
OL,18,Fthe worker was jabbed with the needle
OL,19,Fduring the clean-up and was taken to
OL,20,Fhospital for a Hepatitis B injection as
OL,21,Fa precaution.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
