OL,3,GNEWSAWorker jabbed with needle during
OL,4,Aclean-up after bin lorry fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is understood to be the ninth fire
OL,7,Fin a Glasgow bin lorry this year, with
OL,8,Fthe council previously urging the
OL,9,Fpublic to recycle batteries and vapes
OL,10,Fproperly.
